nserted\"><img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/SXAPages/loyalty-program/alfursan-partners/05052023-alfursan-snb-lak-top.ashx?h=350&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=786dbee48f474e708f2af54d9b34d0b3&amp;hash=1160DDD95F76DAC9D5A1651F1D5699D4\" alt=\"SNB–LAK\"><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"6bef3ba6-99bd-443b-9658-7ef3d8993899\"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----></section></app-jss-image><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"description ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div>\n  <div>\n\n    <p>\n      AlFursan has partnered with the SNB Lak Rewards program so our members can convert Lak points to AlFursan Reward Miles, allowing you to earn Miles without leaving the ground!\n      <br><br>\n      With SNB Lak Rewards you can convert your Lak points to AlFursan Reward Miles at a rate of:\n    </p>\n\n    <ul>\n      <li>7000 Lak points to 1000 AlFursan Reward Miles</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"https://lakreward.alahli.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"External link\">\n        Convert Now\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>\n      ABOUT SNB – LAK\n    </h3>\n\n    <p>\n      The SNB Lak Rewards program rewards their customers by giving Lak points on everyday spend with their SNB AlAhli prepaid and credit card. Customers can earn 1 Lak point from as little as a 1 SAR spent.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      These points can be converted to AlFursan Reward Miles, building your Miles balance towards your next dream holiday.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>\n      How to transfer points\n    </h3>\n\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n        Log in to \n        <a href=\"https://lakreward.alahli.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n          LakRewards.com\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li>Click ‘Points transfer’ under ‘Redeem your Lak points’</li>\n      <li>Fill in and submit the online request form</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>\n      For missing Miles please send an email to:\n    </h3>\n\n    <p>\n      <a href=\"mailto:memberservices@lakrewards.com\">\n        memberservices@lakrewards.com\n      </a>\n      <br>\n      Or contact us through: 9200 155 00\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>\n      Terms and conditions\n    </h3>\n\n    <ul>\n      <li>Customers must correctly enter their AlFursan membership ID</li>\n      <li>The points transferred may take up to 10 business days to be processed</li>\n      <li>Miles are credited within 7 working days</li>\n      <li>\n        Please refer to the SNB Lak program terms and conditions by logging into your account on \n        <a href=\"https://lakreward.alahli.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n          LakRewards.com\n        </a>.\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        References to AlFursan Miles or Miles are to be construed as references to “Reward Miles” as defined in the \n        <a href=\"/sitecore/service/notfound.aspx?item=web%3a%7bA9468489-E135-48B6-A10C-C67B3CA35FDB%7d%40en\">\n          AlFursan Program Terms and Conditions\n        </a>.\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n  </div>\n</div></span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}